WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
The robot picks up the Moka pot and places it on the burner.

00:08.000 --> 00:24.000
[The robot waits while the coffee brews.]

00:24.000 --> 00:37.000
[The brewing sound changes into the completion-phase sputter.]

00:37.000 --> 00:50.000
The robot responds to the acoustic transition and pours the coffee.
